  "result": "Typecheck and the full test suite (616 tests) pass. The three fixes made:\n\n1. **`src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts`** — `updateOrg` no longer unions `enabledFlagOverrides` with the stored list; it replaces the list with whatever the caller supplies (the only caller, `toggleFlag`, already computes the full authoritative set). This fixes disabling an override not sticking.\n2. **`src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts`** — `toggleFlag`'s guard now rejects any flag with `overridable: false`, regardless of its strategy kind (previously a plan-gated non-overridable flag like `webhooks` slipped through the `strategy.kind !== \"plan\"` check).\n3. **`src/lib/feature-flags.ts`** — `isEnabled` now only honors a stored override when `definition.overridable` is true, so a non-overridable flag's stored override (however it got there) has no effect and falls through to its own strategy/plan rule.",
